      "content": "hey so i was moving some heavy boxes earlier today and i felt this crazy ripping sensation in my mid-back. it's kinda spreading down into my stomach too. i'm guessing i just pulled a muscle or something but it hurts a lot. should i just take a bunch of ibuprofen and try to sleep it off?",
